Wine ncrypt: create and import ECDH P-256, P-384 and P-521 keys, accept the curve name parameter and the generic ECC blobs on import, and implement NCryptSecretAgreement and NCryptDeriveKey over bcrypt. FenixSystem 3.0 and the runner agree on a session key this way; ncrypt had no ECDH and both functions were spec stubs.
Applies to wine-cachyos with: patch -p1 --forward --fuzz=0 -i <this file>

